 "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Thanking People and Responding to Thanks"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "In polite conversations, it is important to thank people when they do something for you or help you."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You respond to thanks with expression like <span class = \"italic\">You're welcome</span> or <span class = \"italic\">My pleasure</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are some useful expressions:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Thanking People</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Responding to Thanks</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Formal</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">You shouldn't have!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">This is really kind/sweet of you!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">My pleasure.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">You're very welcome.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Don't mention it!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Informal</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Thanks!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Cheers!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Sure. </span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">No problem.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">No worries.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">It's nothing.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Ann</span>: This is a nice surprise!<br/><span class = \"strong\">Bob</span>: My pleasure. I'm glad you like it."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Allie</span>: Hey! Thanks for the meal!<br/><span class = \"strong\">Billy</span>: Sure! No problem!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to die for"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "delicious; very good to eat"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This pudding is to die for!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use in a conversation about food."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "coconut"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a hard, brown tropical fruit"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love coconut juice!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rice"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a white cereal grain, popular in Asian cuisine"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love green curry and coconut rice."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I'm so full!"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "too much to eat"}, {"type": "part_speech",